<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_2_2_4" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-02">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_2_2_4">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_2_2_4" name="2.2.4 Stockpile Management" processRef="Process_L3_2_2_4"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_2_2_4" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L3/L0 Process. ROM ore and marginal ore delivered by haul trucks to stockpile locations is tracked, graded, and managed to enable blending to mill feed targets. Stockpile inventory bridges Mine Operations and Processing — it is an internal custody transfer point. NOTE: 2.2.4.1 Build ROM Stockpile is executed inside 2.2.3 Hauling (stockpile branch of the destination decision) and is not repeated here.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_2_2_4">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_2_4_mg" name="Mine Geologist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_2_2_4_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_2_4_sc" name="Stockpile Controller / FEL">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Catch_L3_2_2_4_c</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_2_2_4_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_2_2_4_s" name="Stockpile build recorded (from 2.2.3)">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_4_1</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L3_2_2_4_s"/>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_2" name="2.2.4.2 Track Stockpile Grade">
      <bpmn:documentation>Geologist maintains a grade model of each stockpile zone using grade control sample data from contributing blast patterns. Grade model updated as new material is added. For large homogeneous stockpiles, composite sampling may verify predicted grade.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Mine Geologist; Grade Control Geologist
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; AMIRA P754 Principles 2, 6
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (stockpile_inventory — grade attribute)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_4_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_4_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="Catch_L3_2_2_4_c" name="Blend plan issued">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_4_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_4_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L3_2_2_4_c"/>
    </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_3" name="2.2.4.3 Reclaim Material and Blend to Mill Feed">
      <bpmn:documentation>Front-end loader (FEL) or reclaim dozer recovers material from stockpile zones per the blend plan, targeting specified head grade and tonnage rate for mill feed. Reclaim quantities tracked by operator shift records and belt weigh feeder at primary crusher feed point. Reclaim is the handoff from Mine Operations to Processing.
ISA-95 level: 0 / 3
Actors: Stockpile Controller; FEL Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 3; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (stockpile_inventory — reclaim drawdown)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_4_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_2_4_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_2_2_4_e" name="Blended ROM feed delivered to Processing">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_2_4_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L3_2_2_4_e"/>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_2_2_4_s" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_2" targetRef="Catch_L3_2_2_4_c"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_3" sourceRef="Catch_L3_2_2_4_c" targetRef="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_4" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_3" targetRef="End_L3_2_2_4_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_2_2_4">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_2_2_4" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_2_2_4">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_2_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_2_2_4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="766" height="400"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_2_4_mg_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_2_4_mg" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="726" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_2_4_sc_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_2_4_sc" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="220" width="726" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_2_2_4_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_2_2_4_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="87" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="149" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_2"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="75" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Catch_L3_2_2_4_c_di" bpmnElement="Catch_L3_2_2_4_c"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="287" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="396" y="349" width="80" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_2_4_2_2_4_3"><dc:Bounds x="500" y="275" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_2_2_4_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_2_2_4_e"><dc:Bounds x="706" y="287" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="684" y="349" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_4_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="115"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_4_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="390" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="390" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="408" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_4_3"><di:waypoint x="464" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="500" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_2_4_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_2_4_4"><di:waypoint x="670" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="706" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
